These are the files for Life with David, Bare Metal Adventures, Chapter 16, Multi-core, multi-program, multi-memory execution.  
This includes the source, CMakeLists, and linker script files for Demo 2:

Demo 2) Copying an assembly program from FLASH memory to SRAM memory, and then transferring execution of core 0 from a C program in 
        FLASH to the assembly program in SRAM.

